  + exact response JSON string byte count SHA256 optional fixed fault and typed outcome; structuredContent plus fixed summary
  + readonly tools-only ServerHandler list/call/get_info and unknown-tool SDK error

& [Transport]
  + SDK JsonRpcMessageCodec FramedRead over counted Take input aggregate plus-one witness and explicit frame bound
  + FramedWrite under one output mutex with pre-encoding frame checks checked atomic reservation and cancellation fault flag
  + max32 decoded messages and one active semantic guard; own status because SDK send failures are logged rather than inherently terminating
  + whole60-second run_io with caller-owned streams; standalone two-worker runtime max2 blocking workers shutdown_timeout250ms
